{"summary":"志木岛发现与幽灵船和失踪黄金有关的连续杀人线索，柯南在岛上追查伪造枪击和黄金藏匿地点。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-ghost-ship-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0061","episode-0062"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"木下五郎（Goro Kinoshita）。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"木下为寻找志木岛幽灵船失踪的黄金而追杀掌握线索的人，目标是独占被埋藏的巨额黄金。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"木下为逼问滨田浩二而绑架并折磨他，随后杀害知情者；他伪造上原的枪击自杀，并试图把杀人罪嫁祸给毛利小五郎；之后又杀死上原并袭击柯南和三上铃。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"上原的枪伤位于错误的一侧，枪被放在错误的手中；伤口附近有火药灼痕，说明枪击距离和方向与自杀不符；黄金砖块被苔藓覆盖，揭示其长期藏在洞穴废墟中。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南揭露伪造枪击、黄金藏匿和嫁祸计划，木下被制服；黄金原本埋在废墟中，岛民因此一直以为诅咒和债务已经结束。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"A_Ghost_Ship_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri"],"solvedBy":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan, 1st murder)","dcwAirDate":"June 2, 1997 (Part 1)","dcwFillerCaseNumber":"#23","locationsDropped":["Shiki Island"]}